## Title: Satchel Exchange
## Author: clubwratt
## Version: 0.10.0
## APIVersion: 101050
## Description: Opens containers the moment they reach your backpack (turn it on in settings), as fast as the game allows, with an Open Containers wheel entry (LibRadialMenu). Also the one-press satchel vendor loop: Talk, and it opens the store, buys one satchel, exits and unboxes it (e.g. Dremora Vendor Tur).
## SavedVariables: SatchelExchangeSavedVars
## ConsoleDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings
## OptionalDependsOn: LibConsoleLogger LibRadialMenu
